' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006 Web UI — cancellation control
actor Operator
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Mocked proxy" as Proxy
database "State Registry" as Registry
participant Executor
Operator -> UI: confirm cancellation
UI -> Proxy: POST /teams/{selected}/tasks/{task}/controls/cancel
Proxy -> Registry: forward selected-team request
Registry -> Registry: append requested/pending control event
Registry --> UI: 202 pending control
UI -> UI: append feed event; disable button
Executor -> Registry: acknowledged then completed|failed
Registry --> Proxy: selected-team live frames
Proxy --> UI: control result frames
UI -> UI: update feed; lifecycle state unchanged
@enduml
